1
00:00:00,080 --> 00:00:01,859
Which do you think is older...

2
00:00:01,859 --> 00:00:02,630
sharks,

3
00:00:02,630 --> 00:00:04,000
or TREES?

4
00:00:04,040 --> 00:00:05,160
Sharks.

5
00:00:05,160 --> 00:00:07,000
Trees are the new kids.

6
00:00:07,030 --> 00:00:10,567
Rewind almost half a billion years.

7
00:00:10,598 --> 00:00:12,367
No trees anywhere.

8
00:00:12,367 --> 00:00:13,778
The tallest plant came up

9
00:00:13,778 --> 00:00:14,867
to your ankle.

10
00:00:14,895 --> 00:00:17,200
But the sea already had sharks.

11
00:00:17,230 --> 00:00:19,397
Trees showed up about sixty million

12
00:00:19,397 --> 00:00:20,500
years later...

13
00:00:20,540 --> 00:00:22,733
and the sharks watched.

14
00:00:22,780 --> 00:00:24,420
Dinosaurs came...

15
00:00:24,420 --> 00:00:25,533
and went.

16
00:00:25,580 --> 00:00:26,630
Sharks?

17
00:00:26,630 --> 00:00:28,420
Five mass extinctions.

18
00:00:28,420 --> 00:00:29,560
Still swimming.

19
00:00:29,687 --> 00:00:31,380
So when you hug a tree...

20
00:00:31,380 --> 00:00:33,073
you're hugging the new kid.

